## 1. DEVICE IDENTIFICATION:
id: omron-sysmac-nx1p2-9024dt1
name: "Omron Sysmac NX1P2-9024DT1 — Machine Automation Controller; 3.3ns LD; 1.5MB program; 2MB vars; 14DI PNP/NPN 24V; 10DO PNP transistor 0.5A; 4 PTP axes EtherCAT; EtherNet/IP + EtherCAT master; 8 NX expansion units; 16 EtherCAT slaves; 1 option board; 24VDC"
manufacturer: "Omron Corporation"
mcu: "Omron Sysmac NX1P2 CPU engine-9 — 3.3ns LD; 1.5MB program; 450 POUs; 2MB non-retain vars; 4 PTP axes EtherCAT (no synchronized motion); EtherNet/IP + EtherCAT master; IEC 61131-3 full; Sysmac Studio; battery-free program retention"
