  14|digital|false|false|"Q00 — Transistor Output 0 PNP (sourcing); 0.5A/point; 24VDC; ON response 0.5ms; OFF response 1.0ms; load short-circuit protection; max inrush 1A 10ms; leakage 0.1mA; residual voltage ≤1.5VDC; screwless clamping terminal block removable; PNP = common COM is 0V reference; NO PWM or pulse output on built-in DO — use NX-PG0112/PG0122 NX unit for 500kpps pulse output"|"do"
