  24|digital|false|false|"EtherNet/IP — RJ45; 10BASE-T/100BASE-TX; 100 Mbps; STP Cat5e+; max 100m per segment; star topology; protocols: EtherNet/IP CIP tag data link I/O + explicit (256 CIP connections max), Modbus TCP, FINS/TCP, FINS/UDP, HTTP embedded web server, FTP, NTP, SNMP, DHCP, Socket Service; programming via Sysmac Studio over EtherNet/IP; 1514 bytes max frame"|"do;di"
  25|digital|false|false|"EtherCAT Master — RJ45; 100BASE-TX ONLY; 100 Mbps; STP double-shielded Cat5e+; max 100m per segment; line topology (daisy-chain); max 16 EtherCAT slaves; DC (Distributed Clocks) sync 2ms; devices: Omron 1S/G5 servo drives, NX-ECC EtherCAT couplers, NX-ECT slave units, GX-series remote I/O, safety slaves via FSoE (NX-SL/SI/SO); Sysmac Studio topology view; automatic address assignment"|"do;di"
  26|digital|false|false|"OPTION BOARD slot — internal connector; 1 slot (NX1P2-9024DT1 has 1 slot, NX1P2-1140DT1 has 2); accepts: NX1W-CIF01 RS-232C 15m, NX1W-CIF11 RS-422/485 50m non-isolated, NX1W-CIF12 RS-422/485 500m isolated, NX1W-ADB21 2AI 0-10V/0-20mA 12-bit, NX1W-DAB21V 2AO 0-10V 12-bit, NX1W-MAB221 2AI+2AO combo; install with power off only"|"do;di"

